{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00752","headline":"郊庙歌辞 享文敬太子庙乐章 亚献终献 · 崔邠","name":"郊庙歌辞 享文敬太子庙乐章 亚献终献","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"醴齐泛尊彝，轩县动干戚。\n入室僾如在，升阶虔所历。\n奋疾合威容，定利舒皦绎。\n方崇庙貌礼，永被君恩锡。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔邠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00752.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00752","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}